      ":question/problem": "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{\\sqrt{\\pi /12}}^{\\sqrt{\\pi /6}}12x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6{x}^{2})\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}",
